change_type: instructions   changelog: Added imgbb as documented dependency in _meta.json and SKILL.md. Both RunPod and imgbb API keys are now clearly documented as required.

### SKILL.md  [instructions]
- 1. **OpenClaw secrets.json** — `~/.openclaw/secrets.json` at `/runpod/apiKey` and `/imgbb/apiKey` ✅ (already configured)
- No manual setup needed if keys are already in secrets.json.
+ Two keys required — add both to `~/.openclaw/secrets.json`:
+ | Key path | Purpose | Get it from |
+ |----------|---------|-------------|
+ | `/runpod/apiKey` | Call RunPod endpoints | [runpod.io/console/user/settings](https://www.runpod.io/console/user/settings) |
+ | `/imgbb/apiKey` | Upload local images to public URLs (required for edit/video) | [api.imgbb.com](https://api.imgbb.com) |
+ imgbb is used every time you pass a **local file** to an edit or video endpoint — RunPod endpoints only accept public URLs, so the image is temporarily uploaded to imgbb first.
+ 1. **OpenClaw secrets.json** — `~/.openclaw/secrets.json` ✅ (already configured)